  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 17 + 112 ÷ 16 - 8 × 64 = 175 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and x\n\n17 + 112 ÷ 16 - 8 × 64 = 175 ⇒ 17 + 112 × 16 - **8 ÷ 64**__ = 175 \n\n17 + __**112 × 16**__ - 0.125 = 175\n\n__**17 + 1792**__ - 0.125 = 175\n\n__**1775 - 0.125**__ = 175\n\n1774.875 &am",
